%N A087812 Sum of MoebiusMu for numbers between n and 2n inclusive.
%H A087812 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A087812/b087812.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%F A087812 a(n) = M(2*n) - M(n-1), where M(0) = 0 and M(n) = A002321(n) for n >= 1. - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 16 2026
%t A087812 Table[Apply[Plus, Table[MoebiusMu[w], {w, n, 2*n}]], {n, 1, 100}]
%o A087812 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=n, 2*n, moebius(k)); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Nov 15 2025
%Y A087812 Cf. A002321, A008683.
